{"title":"Wedding Itinerary","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Wedding Itinerary","from":"markdown+emoji"},"headingText":"1:45 p.m.","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n![](DSC03105.JPEG){style=\"border-radius: 20px;\" width=100% fig-align=\"left\"}\n\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\">*The venue - our front yard*</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"alert alert-primary alert-dismissible fade show\" role=\"alert\">  <i class=\"bi bi-info-circle\"></i> <strong>Note:</strong> The exact times of each event may change slightly! <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" data-bs-dismiss=\"alert\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button></div>\n\n\nArrive for ceremony.\n\n[23 Kererū Street, Two Mile Bay, Taupō](https://maps.app.goo.gl/5j7wxeS9yqPQtbhw8)\n\nPark on the street.\n\n## 2:00 p.m.\nCeremony begins\n\nWill probably be 30 minutes at the most.\n\n![](pikorua2.png){style=\"border-radius: 30px;\" width=10% fig-align=\"left\"}\n\n\n## 3:15 p.m.\nPhotos, canapés, and drinks.\n\n\n## 5:30 p.m.\nTravel to Acacia Bay for reception. This will include speeches, dinner, and desserts.\n\nHosted at [Acacia Bay Community Hall](https://maps.app.goo.gl/fYhJowR7BJh6WMRZ9) (10 km away, 12 min. drive).\n\n<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2558.2035210780323!2d176.02781177592746!3d-38.703348671766086!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x6d6bf11f9b684809%3A0x31db4e82c102e4cf!2sAcacia%20Bay%20Community%20Hall!5e1!3m2!1sen!2snz!4v1786396991501!5m2!1sen!2snz\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe>\n\n**Transport options**\n\n- Taupō taxis, ph: 07 378 5100. [Website](https://www.taupotaxi.co.nz/). 10 seater vans available.\n- Uber (just use the app as usual).\n- Great Lake Taxis, ph: 07 377 8990. [Website](https://greatlaketaxis.co.nz/). Pre-booking available. Only a single large van available.\n\n\n## 6:00 p.m.\nDinner starts.\n\n## 7:30 onwards.\nParty until closing.\n\nMust be out (or at least quiet) __by 11:30 P.M.__\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n![](DSC03105.JPEG){style=\"border-radius: 20px;\" width=100% fig-align=\"left\"}\n\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\">*The venue - our front yard*</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"alert alert-primary alert-dismissible fade show\" role=\"alert\">  <i class=\"bi bi-info-circle\"></i> <strong>Note:</strong> The exact times of each event may change slightly! <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" data-bs-dismiss=\"alert\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button></div>\n\n\n## 1:45 p.m.\nArrive for ceremony.\n\n[23 Kererū Street, Two Mile Bay, Taupō](https://maps.app.goo.gl/5j7wxeS9yqPQtbhw8)\n\nPark on the street.\n\n## 2:00 p.m.\nCeremony begins\n\nWill probably be 30 minutes at the most.\n\n![](pikorua2.png){style=\"border-radius: 30px;\" width=10% fig-align=\"left\"}\n\n\n## 3:15 p.m.\nPhotos, canapés, and drinks.\n\n\n## 5:30 p.m.\nTravel to Acacia Bay for reception. This will include speeches, dinner, and desserts.\n\nHosted at [Acacia Bay Community Hall](https://maps.app.goo.gl/fYhJowR7BJh6WMRZ9) (10 km away, 12 min. drive).\n\n<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2558.2035210780323!2d176.02781177592746!3d-38.703348671766086!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x6d6bf11f9b684809%3A0x31db4e82c102e4cf!2sAcacia%20Bay%20Community%20Hall!5e1!3m2!1sen!2snz!4v1786396991501!5m2!1sen!2snz\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe>\n\n**Transport options**\n\n- Taupō taxis, ph: 07 378 5100. [Website](https://www.taupotaxi.co.nz/). 10 seater vans available.\n- Uber (just use the app as usual).\n- Great Lake Taxis, ph: 07 377 8990. [Website](https://greatlaketaxis.co.nz/). Pre-booking available. Only a single large van available.\n\n\n## 6:00 p.m.\nDinner starts.\n\n## 7:30 onwards.\nParty until closing.\n\nMust be out (or at least quiet) __by 11:30 P.M.__\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","css":["styles.css"],"toc":true,"from":"markdown+emoji","output-file":"on_the_day.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"Table of contents","toc-title-website":"On this page","related-formats-title":"Other Formats","related-notebooks-title":"Notebooks","source-notebooks-prefix":"Source","other-links-title":"Other Links","code-links-title":"Code Links","launch-dev-container-title":"Launch Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"Launch Binder","article-notebook-label":"Article Notebook","notebook-preview-download":"Download Notebook","notebook-preview-download-src":"Download Source","notebook-preview-back":"Back to Article"